title: Verifying the fix
pid: e9a43537-a8ae-463d-a499-5bd725ab856a
body: |2-
  Do not stop at "it compiled". Confirm the servers actually come up and
  the data loaded:

  #+begin_src bash
  python3 docs/troubleshooting/check-rlibs.py    # expect "all intact"
  ./bash/start-servers.sh &
  #+end_src

  Then look for =Server ready.= in the newest script log,
  =data/jeff/skgconfig.toml.running/start-servers.*.log=, preceded
  by a plausible node/edge count, e.g.:

  #+begin_example
  INFO initialize_dbs: Incremental init succeeded.
  INFO context_computation:   60794 nodes, 56232 edges, 5979 link dests.
  INFO Server ready.
  #+end_example

  and check the configured Skg API port is listening (1730 here):

  #+begin_src bash
  (exec 3<>/dev/tcp/127.0.0.1/1730) && echo "skg up"
  #+end_src
